        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This is an emotion-focused short narrative game with an average playtime of around 1 hour.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>We believe that seeing and understanding our own emotions is a strength in itself. May this inner journey bring you moments of calm and resonance.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Anxiety Puppy</i> is an interactive visual novel that tells the story of a young girl in a bustling city, who, while struggling with the pressures of life and work, unexpectedly embarks on a spiritual journey toward reconciling with her anxiety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her life trajectory seems no different from anyone else’s—studying, finding a job, working, with days that repeat endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, only she knows that beneath every seemingly calm day, anxiety grows like an uncontrollable black line, suffocating her breath and tightening her nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On one of her usual sleepless nights, her anxiety spirals out of control again, and she is pulled into a strange world. What is it? She doesn’t know, but maybe she can talk to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fresh Hand-drawn Style</strong> – A beautiful, healing, original illustrated storybook art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Game Theme</strong> – The game focuses on anxiety and aims to raise players’ awareness of this emotion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warm and Healing Story</strong> – The protagonist will undergo self-exploration through dialogue and interaction, ultimately finding reconciliation with herself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/96cc9a5e3b49d38cca3956ad6b0068a9.poster.avif?t=1789127737\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/96cc9a5e3b49d38cca3956ad6b0068a9.webm?t=1789127737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/96cc9a5e3b49d38cca3956ad6b0068a9.mp4?t=1789127737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her story is not a lonely one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She could be you, or me, or anyone struggling with anxiety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in reality, anxiety is not our enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is more like a well-meaning but awkward friend, and we just haven’t learned how to get along with it yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/bd8720c40b77e79dfac8ffbb01f5e05b.poster.avif?t=1789127737\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/bd8720c40b77e79dfac8ffbb01f5e05b.webm?t=1789127737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/bd8720c40b77e79dfac8ffbb01f5e05b.mp4?t=1789127737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, let anxiety transform into a little puppy, guiding you on a healing journey of self-reconciliation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that the next time you feel anxious, you will no longer criticize your emotions or yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because anxiety is not a monster; it’s just a little puppy easily unsettled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/4a55f1923fc838df35cbaa422731d72a.avif?t=1789127737\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This is an emotion-focused short narrative game with an average playtime of around 1 hour.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>We believe that seeing and understanding our own emotions is a strength in itself. May this inner journey bring you moments of calm and resonance.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Anxiety Puppy</i> is an interactive visual novel that tells the story of a young girl in a bustling city, who, while struggling with the pressures of life and work, unexpectedly embarks on a spiritual journey toward reconciling with her anxiety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her life trajectory seems no different from anyone else’s—studying, finding a job, working, with days that repeat endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, only she knows that beneath every seemingly calm day, anxiety grows like an uncontrollable black line, suffocating her breath and tightening her nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On one of her usual sleepless nights, her anxiety spirals out of control again, and she is pulled into a strange world. What is it? She doesn’t know, but maybe she can talk to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fresh Hand-drawn Style</strong> – A beautiful, healing, original illustrated storybook art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Game Theme</strong> – The game focuses on anxiety and aims to raise players’ awareness of this emotion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warm and Healing Story</strong> – The protagonist will undergo self-exploration through dialogue and interaction, ultimately finding reconciliation with herself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/96cc9a5e3b49d38cca3956ad6b0068a9.poster.avif?t=1789127737\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/96cc9a5e3b49d38cca3956ad6b0068a9.webm?t=1789127737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/96cc9a5e3b49d38cca3956ad6b0068a9.mp4?t=1789127737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her story is not a lonely one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She could be you, or me, or anyone struggling with anxiety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in reality, anxiety is not our enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is more like a well-meaning but awkward friend, and we just haven’t learned how to get along with it yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/bd8720c40b77e79dfac8ffbb01f5e05b.poster.avif?t=1789127737\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/bd8720c40b77e79dfac8ffbb01f5e05b.webm?t=1789127737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/bd8720c40b77e79dfac8ffbb01f5e05b.mp4?t=1789127737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, let anxiety transform into a little puppy, guiding you on a healing journey of self-reconciliation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that the next time you feel anxious, you will no longer criticize your emotions or yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because anxiety is not a monster; it’s just a little puppy easily unsettled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350190/extras/4a55f1923fc838df35cbaa422731d72a.avif?t=1789127737\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Anxiety Puppy is a 2D interactive narrative game that focuses on anxiety. In the game, anxiety is personified as a little puppy. Players will explore its story and try to coexist with it. Go find its traces and give it a hug.",
        "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Spanish - Latin America",
        "reviews": "“Anxiety Puppy offers a short yet warm interactive journey that holds up a mirror to the anxiety of modern life. It is an emotional experience rather than a therapeutic tool that provides solutions. Approaching the game with the intention to relax and to understand your emotions will lead to a more rewarding experience.”<br />\r\n马里奥爷爷<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“Charming, emotional, and thoughtful — a unique narrative that turns anxiety into a companionable journey.”<br />\r\nMassimo Solo<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“This is more than just a game. If you are anxious, insecure, not confident, strongly recommend to play this game by reading through dialogues with the comforting background music. - It just heals you, no matter what.”<br />\r\n审计学家<br />\r\n",
